{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "宽松的滑点",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 69.58,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "你在一个去中心化交易所，用 10 个 ETH 换 USDC。",
   "spoken": "你在一个去中心化交易所，用 10 个 ETH 换 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 1.694,
   "speechEnd": 6.642
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "池子现价，1 个 ETH 换 2000 USDC。这是示例。",
   "spoken": "池子现价，1 个 ETH 换 2000 USDC。这是示例。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.1,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 7.1,
   "speechEnd": 12.036
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "你把滑点设成 5%。",
   "spoken": "你把滑点设成 5%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 12.44,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 12.44,
   "speechEnd": 14.05
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "意思是，最少拿到 19000 USDC。少于这个数，交易就回滚。",
   "spoken": "意思是，最少拿到 19000 USDC。少于这个数，交易就回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 14.5,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 14.599,
   "speechEnd": 20.204
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "交易发出去，先进入公开的内存池，排队等着打包。",
   "spoken": "交易发出去，先进入公开的内存池，排队等着打包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 20.64,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 20.64,
   "speechEnd": 24.569
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "有人在打包之前，读到了它。",
   "spoken": "有人在打包之前，读到了它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 25.02,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 25.119,
   "speechEnd": 27.117
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "他把你的交易，夹在自己的两笔交易中间。",
   "spoken": "他把你的交易，夹在自己的两笔交易中间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 27.56,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 27.56,
   "speechEnd": 31.357
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 31.78,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 31.78,
   "speechEnd": 32.581
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "你最少收到多少？他能让你收到更少吗？",
   "spoken": "你最少收到多少？他能让你收到更少吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 33.04,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 33.135,
   "speechEnd": 36.189
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "你最少收到 19000。他不能让你更少。",
   "spoken": "你最少收到 19000。他不能让你更少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 36.9,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 36.994,
   "speechEnd": 40.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "低于这个数，你的交易回滚，他也赚不到钱。",
   "spoken": "低于这个数，你的交易回滚，他也赚不到钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 40.8,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 40.8,
   "speechEnd": 44.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "所以，他会把价格推到刚好够 19000 的位置。",
   "spoken": "所以，他会把价格推到刚好够 19000 的位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 44.78,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 44.78,
   "speechEnd": 49.448
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "你的交易没有失败。它只是按你允许的最差价格，成交了。",
   "spoken": "你的交易没有失败。它只是按你允许的最差价格，成交了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 49.88,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 49.976,
   "speechEnd": 54.404
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "滑点设 5%，就可能真的付 5%。",
   "spoken": "滑点设 5%，就可能真的付 5%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
   "start": 54.82,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 54.82,
   "speechEnd": 58.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-14",
   "text": "交易在打包之前是公开的，顺序由别人决定。",
   "spoken": "交易在打包之前是公开的，顺序由别人决定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-14.wav",
   "start": 59.04,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 59.04,
   "speechEnd": 62.987
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-15",
   "text": "签名在用过之后仍然存在。能不能再用，取决于你签了什么。",
   "spoken": "签名在用过之后仍然存在。能不能再用，取决于你签了什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg1-15.wav",
   "start": 63.42,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 63.42,
   "speechEnd": 68.175
  }
